{
  "$comment": "真相源。每个被守护的寄存器/协议 wire 布局,fields[].claim 是移植方声明,ref/ref_symbol 锚到 references.json 注册的本地参考树;ldp check-layout 从参考机械导出真值 diff claim(以及可选 driver_src 的驱动实际写法)。旧的 known_wrong_layouts/verification_traces 自指范式已删除:布局真值由钉死的参考机械导出,不靠人手写'我猜会怎么记错'。这正是 SCMI message_id/token 记反那类 bug 的预防(而非事后回归)。",
  "defs": [
    {
      "id": "scmi-msg-header",
      "name": "SCMI Message Header",
      "scope": "protocol",
      "ref": {
        "tree": "linux",
        "file": "drivers/firmware/arm_scmi/common.h"
      },
      "spec_ref": "ARM SCMI spec / Linux pack_scmi_header",
      "width": 32,
      "fields": [
        {
          "name": "message",
          "ref_symbol": "MSG_ID_MASK",
          "claim": {
            "lsb": 0,
            "msb": 7
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "message_type",
          "ref_symbol": "MSG_TYPE_MASK",
          "claim": {
            "lsb": 8,
            "msb": 9
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "protocol",
          "ref_symbol": "MSG_PROTOCOL_ID_MASK",
          "claim": {
            "lsb": 10,
            "msb": 17
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "token",
          "ref_symbol": "MSG_TOKEN_ID_MASK",
          "claim": {
            "lsb": 18,
            "msb": 27
          }
        }
      ],
      "status_codes": {
        "0": "SUCCESS",
        "-1": "NOT_SUPPORTED",
        "-2": "INVALID_PARAMETERS",
        "-4": "NOT_FOUND",
        "-10": "PROTOCOL_ERROR"
      },
      "diagnostic_note": "错误响应 length=8 = header(4)+status(4),证明 length 约定'含 header',可反推请求 length 字段约定。字段 name 用驱动 pack_header 的参数名(message/protocol/token)以便 check-layout 比对驱动实现。"
    },
    {
